  "releaseNotes": "# Changes since version 8.2.3:\n\n## Added\n- Added GcPdfDocument.Optimize() method: optimizes the document and saves it to a file or a stream. (DOC-7057)\n- Added OptimizeDocumentOptions class: represents options controlling the behavior of the GcPdfDocument.Optimize() method. (DOC-7057)\n\n## Fixed\n- Fixed an issue where the AcroForm field hierarchy was generated incorrectly when loading certain PDF files. (DOC-7183)",
